reason = "Line 254 reads `IndexEntry::Assume(_) => return VerifyLevel::Bool(false)`. The outer match on `entry` short-circuits on the Assume variant before reaching the inner `match raw` that resolves Bool(true) via project default. No path through this function returns Method(..) for an Assume entry."

